This script takes the simulation data and then convert them to mimic real data to run through the eventcleaning

to just run the script locally on a single file 
./run_script.sh <YYYYMMDD> 141350221_ers
./run_all this will run all on the local node (slow)

to recompile 
./compile_script.sh

to submit as a job for all nights 
create the file that has all sim files to run over 
./get_folders_tocsv.sh 
then 
condor_submit convertsim2data.submit convertsim2data.submit
    uses ./run_condor.sh for inside the job

 rootcling -f SimRunDataDict.cpp -c SimRunData.h LinkDef.h













